eferrer noopener\\\">Content Marketing<\/a><br\/>-YouTube Marketing<br\/>-Mobile App Marketing<br\/>-Google Ads <br\/>-Pay Per Click Advertising\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/#faq-question-1655962148260\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/#faq-question-1655962148260\",\"name\":\"How much do digital marketers earn in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\" In India, the average salary for a manager in the digital marketing industry is around Rs 8 lakhs per year. In Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai, Hyderabad, and Bangalore, a well-experienced digital marketing manager can earn around Rs 15 lakhs per year.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/#faq-question-1655962175372\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/#faq-question-1655962175372\",\"name\":\"What are the digital marketing career opportunities in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\" Digital marketing offers the following career opportunities in India:<br\/>-<strong>SEO Specialist<\/strong> \u2013 Improve website rankings and organic traffic.<br\/>-<strong>Social Media Manager<\/strong> \u2013 Manage and strategize social media campaigns.<br\/>-<strong>Content Marketer<\/strong> \u2013 Create engaging and valuable content for audiences.<br\/>-<strong>PPC Specialist<\/strong> \u2013 Plan and execute paid ad campaigns on Google and social platforms.<br\/>-<strong>Email Marketing Specialist<\/strong> \u2013 Design and send targeted email campaigns.<br\/>-<strong>Web Analytics Expert<\/strong> \u2013 Analyze data to optimize marketing strategies.<b